# Screenshots from design and verification runs. Agents produce these at the
# repo root; they are review artefacts, not source.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
!static/**/*.png
!static/**/*.jpg
!src/**/*.png
!src/**/*.jpg
# Real e2e fixtures (issue #119: a stub airline-logo image mockAirlineLogos serves),
# not a review screenshot — the blanket rule above would otherwise silently drop it.
!tests/e2e/fixtures/**/*.png
!tests/e2e/fixtures/**/*.jpg
